# Testing (mandatory)

Every feature must have unit tests, written together with the feature.

Minimum per feature:
- Use Cases
- Blocs/Cubits
- Repository implementations (mocked data sources)

Money-moving features also need a widget/flow test: submit → review → confirm → success / failure / unknown.

All tests must pass before any commit. Never commit or merge failing or untested feature code.

If asked to add a feature without these tests, refuse and propose writing tests together with the feature.
